ared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978540/extras/766f4342bb6c8e72a8d815013440e52c.poster.avif?t=1748451647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978540/extras/766f4342bb6c8e72a8d815013440e52c.webm?t=1748451647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978540/extras/766f4342bb6c8e72a8d815013440e52c.mp4?t=1748451647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workers:</strong> Hire and manage a team that keeps your cafe running smoothly, including Login Assistants, Cashiers, Warehouse Managers, Restockers, Technicians, Cleaners, and Chefs. Keep your staff efficient and well-assigned to boost customer satisfaction and daily profits. Every role matters in building your gaming empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978540/extras/92e46981a081d1efe3ccf954ba6f7eec.poster.avif?t=1748451647\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978540/extras/92e46981a081d1efe3ccf954ba6f7eec.webm?t=1748451647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978540/extras/92e46981a081d1efe3ccf954ba6f7eec.mp4?t=1748451647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you rise from a small setup to become the most popular gaming destination in the city? The full journey begins now.</p>",
